5b31-9922-4219-92f3-8254d3d6e2e5\"}}}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/TestPushResponse\"}}}},\"422\":{\"description\":\"Validation Error\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError\"}}}}},\"security\":[{\"BearerAuth\":[]}]}},\"/api/v1/notifications/push-diagnostics\":{\"get\":{\"tags\":[\"Chat Notifications\",\"Chat Notifications\"],\"summary\":\"Push Notification Diagnostics\",\"description\":\"Checks Firebase credential loading/initialization and how many device tokens are registered for the authenticated user. Use before POST /notifications/test-push.\",\"operationId\":\"push_diagnostics_api_v1_notifications_push_diagnostics_get\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{}}}}},\"security\":[{\"BearerAuth\":[]}]}},\"/api/v1/notifications/unread-count\":{\"get\":{\"tags\":[\"Chat Notifications\",\"Chat Notifications\"],\"summary\":\"Get Unread Count\",\"description\":\"Returns unread message and in-app notification counts for the badge. Does not reflect Firebase or Bravo delivery status.\",\"operationId\":\"get_unread_count_api_v1_notifications_unread_count_get\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/UnreadCountResponse\"}}}}},\"security\":[{\"BearerAuth\":[]}]}},\"/api/v1/notifications/preferences\":{\"get\":{\"tags\":[\"Chat Notifications\",\"Chat Notifications\"],\"summary\":\"Get Notification Preferences\",\"description\":\"## Notification channels\\n\\n| UI setting | API field | Provider | Client setup |\\n|------------|-----------|----------|--------------|\\n| Email Notifications | `email_enabled` | SMTP | Server-side email config |\\n| Push/App Notifications | `push_enabled` | **Firebase FCM** | `POST /api/v1/devices/register` with FCM token |\\n| SMS/Text Notifications | `sms_enabled` + `sms_phone_number` | **Bravo SMS** | E.164 phone e.g. `+15551234567` |\\n| In-app badge/history | `in_app_enabled` | Platform | `GET /notifications/unread-count` |\\n\\nOn new chat messages the backend dispatches to enabled channels automatically.\\nSee `GET /notifications/channels` for a machine-readable reference.\\n\\nReturns the current user\u0027s channel toggles and `sms_phone_number` for Bravo.\",\"operationId\":\"get_notification_preferences_api_v1_notifications_preferences_get\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/NotificationPreferenceResponse\"}}}}},\"security\":[{\"BearerAuth\":[]}]},\"put\":{\"tags\":[\"Chat Notifications\",\"Chat Notifications\"],\"summary\":\"Update Notification Preferences\",\"description\":\"## Notification channels\\n\\n| UI setting | API field | Provider | Client setup |\\n|------------|-----------|----------|--------------|\\n| Email Notifications | `email_enabled` | SMTP | Server-side email config |\\n| Push/App Notifications | `push_enabled` | **Firebase FCM** | `POST /api/v1/devices/register` with FCM token |\\n| SMS/Text Notifications | `sms_enabled` + `sms_phone_number` | **Bravo SMS** | E.164 phone e.g. `+15551234567` |\\n| In-app badge/history | `in_app_enabled` | Platform | `GET /notifications/unread-count` |\\n\\nOn new chat messages the backend dispatches to enabled channels automatically.\\nSee `GET /notifications/channels` for a machine-readable reference.\\n\\nSend only fields you want to change. When enabling SMS, include `sms_phone_number` in E.164 format for Bravo delivery.\",\"operationId\":\"update_notification_preferences_api_v1_notifications_preferences_put\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/NotificationPreferenceUpdate\"},\"examples\":{\"firebase_push\":